  "details": "It would be helpful for users to add notes to worlds, much like the user counterpart (https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-notes-to-users).\n\nI'd like to remember a door code, or copy a string of text to save my progress (Idle Home, I'm looking at you). Or sometimes, I'll find a world with a title in a different language, and needed to remember why it was cool to begin with.\n\nOn the world page, have an \"Add Note\" button; identical to the one on the player menu.",
